  = help: message: invalid cron expression "not a valid cron expression": not a valid cron expression
          ^
          The 'Seconds' field does not support using names. 'not' specified.

          The expression must use the 6-field Quartz format with an optional 7th year field:

          sec  min  hour  day-of-month  month  day-of-week  [year]

          Examples:
          "0 0 * * * *"          every hour (on the minute)
          "0 0 8-16 * * MON-FRI" top of each hour, 8 a.m.–4 p.m., weekdays
          "0 */15 * * * *"        every 15 minutes
          "0 0 9 * * MON"         every Monday at 9 a.m.

